Package: snow
Version: 20130616
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: build-essential
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://darkside.com.au/snow/index.html
Description: Steganography tool to conceal messages in text files
 snow is a whitespace steganography program. It hides messages by
 exploiting the invisible trailing whitespace and tab characters at
 the end of lines in a text file. Supports optional compression and
 password-based encryption of the hidden payload.
